Why this licence
----------------
The repository redistributes derivative works of the BodyParts3D 4.0 anatomical
model, which is itself released under CC BY-SA 2.1 Japan. That licence is
share-alike, so the atlas data in public/atlas/ and this viewer as a whole are
distributed under the same terms.

  BodyParts3D, (c) The Database Center for Life Science
  licensed under CC Attribution-Share Alike 2.1 Japan
  https://dbarchive.biosciencedbc.jp/en/bodyparts3d/lic.html

Structure paragraphs and Portuguese names are excerpts from Wikipedia (CC BY-SA)
and Wikidata (CC0). See NOTICE for the full attribution list, including the
third-party software this project depends on.

If you reuse this work, keep the attributions in NOTICE intact and release your
version under the same licence.
